================================================================================
SCOPE OF THE MIT LICENCE ABOVE
================================================================================

The MIT licence above covers the SOFTWARE in this repository: the source code
and scripts (including the Painting the Market and CST baselines under
scripts/baselines/, which are our own reimplementations from the published
papers), the tests, the synthetic toy data under quickstart/toy_data/, and the
metadata under artifacts/ (the corpus manifest, a list of ticker-days and
splits, and the LOB-S5 window-start files, which hold window identifiers and
row offsets only).

It does NOT cover the two files listed in the next section.

================================================================================
LOBSTER-DERIVED STATISTICS -- CC BY-NC 4.0
================================================================================

The following files hold statistics computed from LOBSTER (Nasdaq) limit order
book data:

  - scripts/lib/intraframe_gap_profile.npz
                                         the decoder's gap-profile quantile table
  - assets/bookdit_overview.png          the README overview figure, whose right
                                         panel plots aggregate evaluation
                                         statistics

Copyright (c) 2026 Griffin Galimi, Kang Li, Mihai Cucuringu

These files are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

They are released for non-commercial research and academic use only. In
particular, they may not be used for trading, or to generate investment advice
or trading signals. They are aggregates and plots of aggregates; they contain
no LOBSTER order book or message records.

================================================================================
NOTE ON DATA -- NO LOBSTER DATA IS INCLUDED
================================================================================

This repository does NOT contain or redistribute any LOBSTER data. LOBSTER
limit order book and message data is licensed by LOBSTER
(https://lobsterdata.com) and may not be redistributed. No order book, message
file, reconstructed order book tensor, generated sample or trained model
weights derived from LOBSTER is included here.

To run any part of this repository that reads real market data -- corpus
construction, model training, or the official LOB-Bench evaluation -- you must
hold your own LOBSTER subscription and obtain the data directly from LOBSTER
(https://lobsterdata.com) under its terms. See docs/REPRODUCE.md section 1.1.

================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

Third-party components are not vendored here. The LOB-Bench evaluation library
and the LOB-S5 baseline are cloned at pinned commits by
scripts/data/setup_libs.sh and remain subject to their own licences.
